#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-ae3.rst:681
msgid ""
"``I2C1`` and ``I2C2`` can also be used in target (slave) mode through "
":ref:`machine.I2CTarget <machine.I2CTarget>` to expose a memory region to "
