"mémoire à un autre contrôleur I²C ::"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-ae3.rst:692
msgid ""
"The **LPI2C** peripheral is not exposed in firmware. It would only support "
"**target (slave) mode** if exposed, and ``I2C1`` and ``I2C2`` already cover "
"both controller and target operation."
msgstr ""
